5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm Yumi. I'm really excited to be here with you all.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hi... I'm Daisuke. Nice to meet you all.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Daisuke"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Daisuke**: Hi... I'm Daisuke. Nice to meet you all.""}]}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Asuka. I’ll keep my comments brief and logical.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Asuka"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Asuka**: Asuka. I’ll keep my comments brief and logical.""}]}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello, dear children. It is wonderful to meet you all.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Shizue**: Hello, dear children. It is wonderful to meet you all.""}]}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hi, I'm Midori. It's lovely to meet everyone.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,Let's get to know each other better! Who here has any experience with these games?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I haven't played before. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my best to listen.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"I have played before. I rely on logic, not emotion, to identify the threat.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"I am new to this, but I trust my heart. Let us all be kind and watchful together.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I’m new too, but I’ll do my best to help. Let’s stay calm and work together.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I’m new too, but I’ll do my best to help. Let’s stay calm and work together.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. Staying calm is important. I will listen carefully to everyone’s words.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will observe your behavior closely. Logic will reveal the truth, not your words.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I appreciate your caution, Asuka. Let us all support one another with kindness and understanding.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. Let’s keep the atmosphere friendly while we figure out who to trust.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I agree with Shizue. Let’s keep the atmosphere friendly while we figure out who to trust.""}]}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Let’s wrap up Day 0. I hope we can all sleep well and wake up ready to find the truth.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I hope so too. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Goodnight. I will be watching.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
