31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning everyone. I have some information to share, but I need to be careful about how I reveal it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I’m listening. Please tell us what you know.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am skeptical of vague claims. If you have evidence, present it clearly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Please share what you know, Yumi. We are all here to help you.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m here for you, Yumi. Please take your time and share what feels safe.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I am the Seer. I checked Midori last night, and she is definitely human.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"That is a huge relief. Thank you for checking, Yumi. I feel much safer knowing Midori is safe.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Midori is human. That eliminates one variable. Who else have you checked, Yumi?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you, Yumi. Knowing Midori is safe brings us all great comfort.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, Yumi. I’m so relieved to know I’m safe. I’ll do my best to help you find the werewolf.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I haven’t checked anyone else yet. I need to choose carefully for tonight to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I understand. Please choose wisely. I will support your decision, whatever it may be.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for Daisuke. His excessive trust in your unverified claims is suspicious.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am deeply troubled by this sudden accusation, Daisuke. Please, let us not turn on each other so quickly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I’m shocked by that accusation, Asuka. Daisuke was just being kind. Let’s not jump to conclusions without more evidence.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I stand by Midori. Asuka, your accusation is baseless. Let’s focus on finding the real threat, not attacking allies.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I am sorry for causing trouble. I only wanted to be helpful. Please, let’s find the real danger together.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,My logic remains sound. Daisuke’s blind faith is a vulnerability. I will not retract my vote.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am worried, Asuka. Please, let us not divide ourselves. We must find the true werewolf together.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Yumi. Asuka, please reconsider. Daisuke is clearly just nervous, not suspicious. Let’s stay united.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
